    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "349dc0621b814bee7e47": "Um, you already know everything I could teach you. Maybe it's time for you to talk to someone else. Try the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She's got some real talent!",
        "4b1ea3f3e7e5e598438c": "That's nice, $n. Go show whatever it is to Vosur over there. He'll answer any questions you have.",
        "6aa54943e1710d34dfb6": "Don't let the beady eyes and bushy beard fool you. Vosur's a talented apprentice and a good friend, even if I do get a crick in my neck when I talk to him.",
        "759161d5e1cf7e30fe25": "Train me.",
        "bca94f22f2ee7296a7e4": "Who are you and why are you bothering me? Oh, right--potions student. Right. What can I do for you?"
      },
      "name": "Tally Berryfizz",
      "subName": "Expert Alchemist",
      "translationMetadata": {
